  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 2.1\n\n### Main package\n* Updated internal Polyfill version from 9.1.0 to 9.3.0\n* Update ``FilePathResolver`` file resolving code to ensure Target File Path is an Executable File and throw an Exception if it is not (#208 )\n* Updated ``FilePathResolver`` to use DotPrimitives to assist with Path Environment Variable Resolving code (#208)\n* Updated code to use Argument Exception throwing polyfills (#210) and address nullability warnings \n* Removed some no longer needed internal Helper code\n* Fixed typos in Localized Excestrings",
